# The Legend of Yangchen, chapter III: "Exile this Saga, then return it to the battlefield transformed under your control",
# as Avatar Yangchen (CR 712.14a), a 4/5 Legendary Creature - Avatar with flying. "Whenever you cast your second spell each
# turn, airbend up to one other target nonland permanent." Bot1 casts Mox Pearl on turn 3 (a spell on an earlier turn), then on
# turn 5, the turn it flips, a first Mox Pearl (no trigger) and a second (trigger). The trigger refuses a land and Avatar
# Yangchen herself ("other"), takes any other nonland permanent - Bot2's Mox Pearl, an opponent's - and exiles it (CR 701.65a).

